                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「世界级艺术家和地方私立学校的美术讲师……草薙同学和御桜，",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "到了现在，没有任何交集也是理所当然的吗……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00102",
        linknext = "block_00104"
    },
    block_00104 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「嗯，是啊」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00103",
        linknext = "block_00105"
    },
    block_00105 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000758", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「可是，我不一样」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00104",
        linknext = "block_00106"
    },
    block_00106 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000759", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我们总有一天会超越御桜禀」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00105",
        linknext = "block_00107"
    },
    block_00107 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「超越御桜禀啊……还在说这种话啊……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00106",
        linknext = "block_00108"
    },
    block_00108 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000760", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「当然了，因为一直为此在努力啊」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00107",
        linknext = "block_00109"
    },
    block_00109 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你们的努力看起来只是在挑衅社会吧？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00108",
        linknext = "block_00110"
    },
    block_00110 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000761", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「那跟草薙健一郎有什么区别？跟那个御桜禀有什么区别？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00109",
        linknext = "block_00111"
    },
    block_00111 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000762", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「御桜禀也不过是因为年轻又漂亮所以关注度高，因为一个小小的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "意外才得了奖而已」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00110",
        linknext = "block_00112"
    },
    block_00112 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「小小的意外？别犯傻了……那根本不是什么意外」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00111",
        linknext = "block_00113"
    },
    block_00113 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_03", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000763", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我知道」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00112",
        linknext = "block_00114"
    },
    block_00114 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000764", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「可是，世间的那些蠢货会那样想吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00113",
        linknext = "block_00115"
    },
    block_00115 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000765", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才的价值啊，大众是理解不了的。那些人不管走到哪里，都只",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "是被周围的评价所左右，稀里糊涂地决定自己的评价而已」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00114",
        linknext = "block_00116"
    },
    block_00116 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000766", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才的价值，只有才人才明白」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00115",
        linknext = "block_00117"
    },
    block_00117 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_05", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000767", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「像我这样，中途半端的才能，成不了天才，却也不是凡人，只有",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "这样的人才能明白」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00116",
        linknext = "block_00118"
    },
    block_00118 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「以前不是自称凡人来着，现在不是凡人了吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00117",
        linknext = "block_00119"
    },
    block_00119 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000768", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「毕竟也努力了这么多年。称得上才人了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00118",
        linknext = "block_00120"
    },
    block_00120 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「然后呢？你为什么要执着于御桜禀？你喜欢她吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00119",
        linknext = "block_00121"
    },
    block_00121 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000769", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「喜欢。但比起喜欢，恨意更大」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00120",
        linknext = "block_00122"
    },
    block_00122 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000770", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「才人爱天才，又恨天才」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00121",
        linknext = "block_00123"
    },
    block_00123 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「原来如此，那种爱恨交织就像《莫扎特传》里莫扎特和安东尼奥·",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "萨列里的关系啊……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00122",
        linknext = "block_00124"
    },
    block_00124 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_01", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000771", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「啊，那部电影我小时候也看过。天才莫扎特和才人萨列里的故事」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00123",
        linknext = "block_00125"
    },
    block_00125 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000772", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「莫扎特无与伦比的音乐才能受到大众的赞美，而天真烂漫又粗俗",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "无礼的人格则遭到其他作曲家的轻蔑」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00124",
        linknext = "block_00126"
    },
    block_00126 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000773", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「然而唯独萨列里一人理解了'莫扎特的才能是受到神眷顾的唯一至",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "高之物'，意识到自己只有看懂莫扎特真正价值的才能，只不过是个",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "才人而已」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00125",
        linknext = "block_00127"
    },
    block_00127 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000774", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「而对莫扎特的强烈嫉妒折磨着萨列里的苦恼，催生出了巨大的悲",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "剧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00126",
        linknext = "block_00128"
    },
    block_00128 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000775", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才与才人。最难逾越，又充满了爱恨交织的关系」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00127",
        linknext = "block_00129"
    },
    block_00129 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你也会被那样的悲剧所吞噬的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00128",
        linknext = "block_00130"
    },
    block_00130 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000776", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「不会，历史不是只属于天才的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00129",
        linknext = "block_00131"
    },
    block_00131 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000777", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「有时候，才人也能凌驾于天才之上」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00130",
        linknext = "block_00132"
    },
    block_00132 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000778", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「不如说，所谓天才，并不仅仅是让我们才人战栗的存在，也可以",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "说是顺应了时代潮流的才人」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00131",
        linknext = "block_00133"
    },
    block_00133 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000779", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我一定会到达她所在的位置」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00132",
        linknext = "block_00134"
    },
    block_00134 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「……那可真了不起」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00133",
        linknext = "block_00135"
    },
    block_00135 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不过，被无视了吧？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00134",
        linknext = "block_00136"
    },
    block_00136 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_05", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000780", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00135",
        linknext = "block_00137"
    },
    block_00137 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「刚才你说'跟那个人也合不来'，那个人指的是御桜禀吧？大概是你",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "们一直在主动示好，却每次都被无视了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00136",
        linknext = "block_00138"
    },
    block_00138 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不是这样的吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00137",
        linknext = "block_00139"
    },
    block_00139 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_03", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000781", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「是啊……」"
                }
            }
